            }
          ],
          "question": {
            "text": "$\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}+\\mathrm{NH}_3 \\rightleftharpoons\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)\\right]^{+} ; k_1=3.5 \\times 10^{-3}$ $\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)\\right]^{+}+\\mathrm{NH}_3 \\rightleftharpoons\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_2\\right]^{+} ; k_2=1.7 \\times 10^{-3}$ then the formation constant of $\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_2\\right]^{+}$is",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "c37B7",
              "text": "\n$6.08 \\times 10^{-6}$\n",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": true
            },
            {
              "id": "RjtDg",
              "text": "\n$6.08 \\times 10^6$\n",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "yX3Pp",
              "text": "\n$6.08 \\times 10^{-9}$\n",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "oo77G",
              "text": "\nNone of these",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "(i) $\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}+\\mathrm{NH}_3 \\rightleftharpoons\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)\\right]^{+} ; k_1=3.5 \\times 10^{-3}$\n(ii) $\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)\\right]^{+}+\\mathrm{NH}_3 \\rightleftharpoons\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_2\\right]^{+}, k_2=1.7 \\times 10^{-3}$\non the basis of above reaction\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& k_1=\\frac{\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)\\right]^{+}}{\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right]} \\\\\n& k_2=\\frac{\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_2\\right]^{+}}{\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)\\right]^{+}\\left[\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right]}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nFor the formation of $\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_2\\right]^{+}$\n$$\n\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}+2 \\mathrm{NH}_3 \\rightleftharpoons\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_2\\right]^{+}\n$$\nFormation constant $(K)=\\frac{\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_2\\right]^{+}}{\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right]^2}$\nFrom eq. (i) and (ii)\n$$\nK=k_1 \\times k_2=3.5 \\times 10^{-3} \\times 1.7 \\times 10^{-3}=5.95 \\times 10^{-6} \\approx 6.08 \\times 10^{-6}\n$$",
            "image": null
          },
