          "question": {
            "text": "The thermal dissociation equilibrium of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is studied under different conditions.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>CaCO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><mtext>CaO</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mtext>g</mtext></mfenced></math><br />For this equilibrium, the correct statement(s) is/are",
            "image": null
